# Runtime audit trail. Written next to the state files; when dataDir falls back to the plugin
# directory (a wiped profile patch), it lands here — evidence, never source.
.graft-audit.jsonl
# The pending-ignition queue: also `<dataDir>/` state, and it was TRACKED until 2026-11-08 (found by
# `git ls-files`) — so a user's unsent ignition intent could have been committed and shipped. Tests
# write it under their own temp dirs, and an absent file reads as an empty queue, so untracking it
# changes nothing except what git sees.
.graft-pending-ignition.json
# The cross-plugin layout manifest (P1-2). Written when `configureRetiredStore` resolves the store
# directory, which is this directory whenever the profile patch points nowhere.
.layout.json
# The pending-constraint queue: <dataDir>/ runtime state, same class as the section ledger above.
# It was TRACKED until 2026-11-10 (found by a stray git add -A) — runtime state must not be shipped.
# Untracking changes nothing except what git sees: an absent file reads as an empty queue.
.pending-constraints.json

# Local experiment/measurement records (measure-efficiency --out, probes). Never source.
_scratch/

